SUMMARY:15 Years OF Filmmaking Showcase
DTSTAMP:20260704T105334Z
DTSTART:20251115T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate 15 years of filmmaking with Micole Williams at t
	he Will-M-Power Films event – it’s a blast from the past\, present and fut
	ure!\n\n\n\n3 films = 1 Saturday! Celebrate 15 years of Filmmaking with th
	e empowering works of Houston-native Filmmaker\, Micole Williams. Whether 
